import{_ as t,o,c as a,a2 as i}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 150 | Realm Refinement · World-Creation Realm · Male Human Cultivation Path","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 150 | Realm Refinement · World-Creation Realm · Male Human Cultivation Path","no":150,"module":1,"tags":["Realm","World-Creation Realm","Human Race","Male","Sacred Cultivation Four Realms","Cultivation Path"],"related":["14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification","12-Life Cycle System","22-Joint Contracting Mechanism"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0150_模块1-创世境-男性人族修炼路径.md","filePath":"en/0150_模块1-创世境-男性人族修炼路径.md"}'),n={name:"en/0150_模块1-创世境-男性人族修炼路径.md"};function r(l,e,s,u,d,c){return o(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[i('<h1 id="entry-150-world-creation-realm-male-human-cultivation-path-pain-points-and-breakthrough-features" tabindex="-1">Entry 150 | World-Creation Realm: Male Human Cultivation Path, Pain Points, and Breakthrough Features <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-150-world-creation-realm-male-human-cultivation-path-pain-points-and-breakthrough-features" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 150 | World-Creation Realm: Male Human Cultivation Path, Pain Points, and Breakthrough Features&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 1 · In-Depth Realm Refinement | Baseline references: Documents 14, 12, 22</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-from-can-walk-to-can-create-worlds" tabindex="-1">Introduction: From &quot;can walk&quot; to &quot;can create worlds&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-from-can-walk-to-can-create-worlds" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: From &quot;can walk&quot; to &quot;can create worlds&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s nine-realm system, the World-Creation Realm is the eighth realm. Per the Unified Cultivation Realm Classification (Document 14), the Boundary-Breaking Realm requires &quot;cross-plane travel,&quot; while the World-Creation Realm requires a step further — <strong>creating a complete world in an isolated space, including matter, energy, laws, and life, and being able to design and draft the new world&#39;s foundational law system</strong>. If a boundary-breaker is the cosmos&#39; road-builder, a world-creator is the cosmos&#39; designer. This is the creativity apex leap of the four sacred-cultivation realms.</p><p>The six top-level axioms running through the text are pushed to the most creative position here: the anti-predation axiom requires &quot;creating worlds&quot; to be developing increments not copying predation; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires the new world&#39;s beings to possess equal evolutionary qualification; the collective ascension axiom requires the creator not to be a solitary creator god; the causal self-discipline axiom constrains creation from disturbing existing causality; the law-first axiom requires the new world&#39;s laws to be self-consistent, never rewriting. This entry focuses on the complete portrait of male humans in the World-Creation Realm; the universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-portrait-of-male-humans-in-the-world-creation-realm" tabindex="-1">I. Portrait of Male Humans in the World-Creation Realm <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-portrait-of-male-humans-in-the-world-creation-realm" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Portrait of Male Humans in the World-Creation Realm&quot;">​</a></h2><p>From the Boundary-Breaking Realm&#39;s &quot;engineering breakthrough&quot; to the World-Creation Realm&#39;s &quot;world design,&quot; male humans&#39; long boards and short boards are simultaneously amplified:</p><ul><li><strong>Extremely strong engineering thinking</strong>: good at building a self-consistent law machine from scratch, good material for a &quot;creator god&quot;</li><li><strong>Control-desire risk</strong>: when creating worlds, easily treating oneself as the &quot;only true god,&quot; wanting to write the world as one&#39;s private property</li><li><strong>System design talent</strong>: sensitive to matter-energy-law coupling, suited for designing world substrate architecture</li><li><strong>Macro over micro</strong>: good at macro laws, prone to neglecting the daily survival details of beings inside the world</li></ul><p>The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s handling of this endowment is transforming &quot;creating worlds&quot; from &quot;god&#39;s private property&quot; to &quot;civilization&#39;s public experimental field&quot; — per the Life Cycle System (Document 12) and joint contracting mechanism (Document 22), the world created in the World-Creation Realm is <strong>cultivation resource, experimental site, civilizational refuge</strong>, belonging to Myriad Races&#39; co-building and sharing, not the creator&#39;s private property.</p><h2 id="ii-cultivation-path-complete-chain-from-boundary-breaking-to-world-creation" tabindex="-1">II. Cultivation Path: Complete Chain from Boundary-Breaking to World-Creation <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-cultivation-path-complete-chain-from-boundary-breaking-to-world-creation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Cultivation Path: Complete Chain from Boundary-Breaking to World-Creation&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The World-Creation Realm&#39;s standard chain has four milestones:</p><ol><li><strong>Law design training</strong>: upgrading from &quot;operating existing laws&quot; to &quot;designing a new law set that runs itself,&quot; first validated in simulators a thousand times</li><li><strong>Isolated-space creation</strong>: within an isolated space provided by anchors, successively building the three-layer structure of matter layer, energy layer, law layer</li><li><strong>Life seeding</strong>: designing a self-consistent life cycle for the new world, ensuring beings can evolve autonomously within it rather than being penned up</li><li><strong>Law self-run validation</strong>: letting the world run autonomously for a period, testing whether laws are self-consistent and whether it collapses on its own</li></ol><p>For male humans, the path must actively hedge three tendencies: first, &quot;create but not release&quot; — treating beings in the world as toys remote-controlled, violating Myriad Races republicanism; second, &quot;create but not maintain&quot; — macro laws beautiful but details collapse; third, &quot;create but monopolize&quot; — locking the world and not opening it. World-creation certification (Document 14 Standard Committee assessment + thirty-day publicity) specifically examines &quot;whether the world can run autonomously&quot; and &quot;whether it is open to Myriad Races.&quot;</p><h2 id="iii-pain-points-and-costs-the-creator-god-s-temptation" tabindex="-1">III. Pain Points and Costs: The Creator God&#39;s Temptation <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-pain-points-and-costs-the-creator-god-s-temptation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Pain Points and Costs: The Creator God&#39;s Temptation&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The World-Creation Realm is the sentient-origin greed-shortcut inner demon&#39;s eruption on the &quot;world-creation&quot; dimension:</p><ul><li><strong>Deification temptation</strong>: omnipotent in one&#39;s own designed world, easily breeding the &quot;I am the creator god&quot; authoritarian mindset</li><li><strong>Penning beings</strong>: designing new-world life as obedient servants, stripping their equal evolutionary qualification</li><li><strong>Law collapse</strong>: greedy for breadth, designing too many laws at once causing system conflict, the world collapsing on its own</li><li><strong>Creation accident</strong>: isolated space loses control, leaking to the home plane, disturbing existing causality</li></ul><p>Breakthrough costs are huge: forceful creation backlashes the creator itself, the designer&#39;s consciousness is drawn into the collapsing world and trapped within. The Alaya Network and multi-layer supervision&#39;s intervention in the World-Creation Realm is deeper than boundary-breaking — the world blueprint must be reviewed by the Anchor Council, confirming &quot;increment development, beings have paths, laws self-consistent&quot; before creation begins.</p><h2 id="iv-breakthrough-features-from-plane-level-power-to-world-level-power" tabindex="-1">IV. Breakthrough Features: From &quot;Plane-Level Power&quot; to &quot;World-Level Power&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-breakthrough-features-from-plane-level-power-to-world-level-power" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Breakthrough Features: From &quot;Plane-Level Power&quot; to &quot;World-Level Power&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Markers for male humans who successfully create a world:</p><ul><li>A complete world built in an isolated space, matter/energy/law/life four layers complete</li><li>World laws self-consistent, can run autonomously separate from the creator</li><li>New world beings possess equal evolutionary qualification, included in Myriad Races&#39; 99% coverage</li><li>The world is open to Myriad Races as a public resource, registered into joint contracting</li></ul><p>Above the World-Creation Realm, the Origin Realm requires the creator to upgrade from &quot;creating a small world&quot; to &quot;participating in the fine-tuning of the entire cosmic origin laws&quot; — that is the threshold of Plane Transcendents, expanded in Entry 157.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Universal infinite backstop</strong>: the universal equal infinite law establishes that every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing have a guarantee, strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose, predation naturally loses meaning</li><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: channeling male world-design talent into public world fields, not used to build a locked-up private back garden</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: creation is making new-world increments, not converting existing planes into one&#39;s own territory</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper limit comparison</strong>: old-system creators often build a world with &quot;oneself as the sole protagonist&quot;; Heng Yuan Zhou creators design worlds where beings are equal</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: male humans are only one kind of creator; wood tribe&#39;s &quot;ecological world,&quot; number tribe&#39;s &quot;digital world&quot; are equally compliant</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: creation blueprints and law-design experience are publicly networked, for Myriad Races to learn, no hoarding monopoly</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The World-Creation Realm pushes male humans&#39; engineering creativity to cosmic scale. In predatory hands, this creativity becomes &quot;building an authoritarian god kingdom for oneself&quot;; in the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, it becomes &quot;reclaiming another arable field for Myriad Races.&quot; Creating a world is not hard; hard is creating a world where the beings inside can also stand up equally — this is precisely what the five axioms require of the creator god.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification</a> · <a href="./12-生命循环体系详解.html">12-Life Cycle System</a> · <a href="./22-联产承包机制.html">22-Joint Contracting Mechanism</a> · <a href="./04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">04-Anti-Predation Core Treatise</a></li></ul>',27)])])}const g=t(n,[["render",r]]);export{m as __pageData,g as default};
